{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-73-1","title":"Psalms 73:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":73,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":73,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The prophet, prevailing in a temptation, 2 shews the occasion thereof, the prosperity of the wicked; 13 the wound given thereby, diffidence; 15 the victory over it, knowledge of God's purpose, in destroying the wicked, and sustaining the righteous.</p>\n<p>(Title.) of. or, for. 50:1; 74:1; 83:1; *titles 1Ch 6:39; 15:17; 16:7,37; 25:1-6; 2Ch 29:30 Truly. or, Yet. 2:6; 42:11 God. 18-28; 84:11; Isa 63:7-9; Lu 12:32 to such. Joh 1:47; Ro 2:28,29; 4:16; 9:6,7 of a clean heart. Heb. clean of heart. 51:10; Jer 4:14; Mt 5:8; Tit 3:5; Jas 4:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-73-2","title":"Psalms 73:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":73,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":73,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>But. 5:7; 17:15; 35:13; Jos 24:15; 1Sa 12:23; 1Ch 22:7; Job 21:4 feet. 116:8; 1Sa 2:9; Ro 7:23,24 steps. 17:5; 38:16; 94:18; Job 12:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-73-3","title":"Psalms 73:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":73,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":73,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>I was. 37:1,7; Job 21:7; Pr 3:31; 24:1; Jer 12:1; Jas 4:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-73-4","title":"Psalms 73:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":73,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":73,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>no. 17:14; Job 21:23,24; 24:20; Ec 2:16; 7:15; Lu 16:22 firm. Heb. fat. 17:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-73-5","title":"Psalms 73:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":73,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":73,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>They are. 12; Job 21:6; Pr 3:11,12; Jer 12:1,2; 1Co 11:32; Heb 12:8; Re 3:19 in trouble as other. Heb. in the trouble of other. like.Heb. with.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-73-6","title":"Psalms 73:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":73,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":73,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>Therefore. De 8:13,14; 32:15; Es 3:1,5,6; 5:9-11; Job 21:7-15; Ec 8:11 Jer 48:11,29; Eze 28:2-5; Da 4:30 as a chain. Jud 8:26; Pr 1:9; So 4:9; Isa 3:19; Eze 16:11 violence. Pr 3:31; *marg: Pr 4:17; Mic 2:1,2; 3:5; Jas 5:4-6 covereth. 109:18,29; 1Pe 5:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-73-7","title":"Psalms 73:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":73,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":73,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>eyes. 17:10; 119:70; Job 15:27; Isa 3:9; Jer 5:28; Eze 16:49 have, etc. Heb. pass the thoughts of the heart. 12; 17:14; 1Sa 25:2,36; Lu 12:16-19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-73-8","title":"Psalms 73:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":73,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":73,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>corrupt. 53:1-4; Pr 30:13,14 speak wickedly. 10:2,10,11; 12:4,5; Ex 1:9,10; 1Sa 13:19; 1Ki 21:7-29; Jer 7:9-11 Ho 7:16 speak loftily. 2Pe 2:10; Jude 1:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-73-9","title":"Psalms 73:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":73,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":73,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>set. Ex 5:2; 2Ch 32:15; Job 21:14; Da 3:15; 7:25; Re 13:6 tongue. 52:4; Lu 18:4; Jas 3:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-73-10","title":"Psalms 73:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":73,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":73,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>waters. 75:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-73-11","title":"Psalms 73:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":73,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":73,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>How. 9; 10:11; 94:7; Job 22:13,14; Eze 8:12; Zep 1:12 is there. 44:21; 139:1-6; Ho 7:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-73-12","title":"Psalms 73:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":73,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":73,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>these. 37:35; 52:7; Jer 12:1,2; Lu 16:19; Jas 5:1-3 prosper. 3 they. 17:14; 62:10; Jer 5:17,28; Ho 12:7,8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-73-13","title":"Psalms 73:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":73,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":73,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>Verily. Job 9:27,31; 21:15; 34:9; 35:3; Mal 3:14 washed. 24:4; 26:6; 51:10; Heb 10:19-22; Jas 4:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-73-14","title":"Psalms 73:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":73,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":73,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>For all. 34:19; 94:12; Job 7:3,4,18; 10:3,17; Jer 15:18; Am 3:2; Heb 12:5 1Pe 1:6 chastened. Heb. my chastisement was.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-73-15","title":"Psalms 73:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":73,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":73,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>offend. 1Sa 2:24; Mal 2:8; Mt 18:6,7; Ro 14:15,21; 1Co 8:11-13 generation. 22:30; 24:6; 1Pe 2:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-73-16","title":"Psalms 73:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":73,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":73,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>When. 36:6; 77:19; 97:2; Pr 30:2,3; Ec 8:17; Ro 11:33 too painful for me. Heb. labour in mine eyes. 39:6; Lu 18:32-34; Joh 16:18,19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-73-17","title":"Psalms 73:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":73,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":73,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>Until. 27:4; 63:2; 77:13; 119:24,130 then. 37:37,38; Job 27:8; Ec 8:12,13; Jer 5:31; Lu 12:20; 16:22,23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-73-18","title":"Psalms 73:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":73,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":73,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>Surely. 35:6; De 32:35; Jer 23:12 thou castedst. 37:20,24,35-38; 55:23; 92:7; 94:23; 2Th 1:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-73-19","title":"Psalms 73:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":73,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":73,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>How. 58:9; Job 20:5; Isa 30:13; Ac 2:23; 1Th 5:3; Re 18:10 they are. Nu 17:12,13; 1Sa 28:20; Job 15:21; 20:23-25; Pr 28:1; Isa 21:3,4 Da 5:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-73-20","title":"Psalms 73:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":73,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":73,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>As a. 90:5; Job 20:8; Isa 29:7,8 when. 7:6; 78:65 their. 39:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-73-21","title":"Psalms 73:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":73,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":73,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>my heart. 3; 37:1,7 in my. Job 16:13; La 3:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-73-22","title":"Psalms 73:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":73,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":73,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>So. 69:5; 92:6; Pr 30:2; Ec 3:18 ignorant. Heb. I knew not. as a. 32:9; Isa 1:3 before thee. Heb. with thee.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-73-23","title":"Psalms 73:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":73,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":73,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>Nevertheless. 16:8; 23:4; 139:1-12,18; Ge 17:1; Mt 1:23; 28:20; Heb 13:5 thou hast. 37:17,24; 63:8; Isa 41:10,13; 42:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-73-24","title":"Psalms 73:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":73,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":73,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>Thou. 16:7; 25:9; 32:8; 48:14; 143:8-10; Pr 3:5,6; 8:20; Isa 30:21; 48:17 Isa 58:8,11; Lu 11:13; Joh 16:13; Jas 1:5 receive. 49:15; 84:11; Lu 23:46; Joh 14:3; 17:5,24; Ac 7:59; 2Co 5:1 1Pe 1:4,5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-73-25","title":"Psalms 73:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":73,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":73,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>Whom. 16:5,11; 17:15; 37:4; 43:4; 63:3; 89:6; Mt 5:8; Php 3:8; 1Jo 3:2 Re 21:3,22,23 none upon. 42:1,2; 104:34; 143:6-8; Isa 26:8,9; Hab 3:17,18; Mt 10:37; Php 3:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-73-26","title":"Psalms 73:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":73,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":73,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>flesh. 63:1; 84:2; 119:81,82; Job 13:15; 2Co 4:8-10,16-18; Php 1:21 2Ti 4:6-8; 2Pe 1:14 but. 18:2; 27:14; 138:3; Isa 40:29-31; 2Co 12:9,10 strength. Heb. rock. portion. 16:5,6; 119:57; 142:5; La 3:24; Re 21:3,4,7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-73-27","title":"Psalms 73:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":73,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":73,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>lo. 119:155; Job 21:14,15; Isa 29:13; Jer 12:2; Mt 15:7,8; Eph 2:13,17 that go. Ex 34:15; Nu 15:39; Jas 4:4; Re 17:1-5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-73-28","title":"Psalms 73:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":73,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":73,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>But. 65:4; 84:10; 116:7; La 3:25,26; Lu 15:17-20; Heb 10:19-22; Jas 4:8 1Pe 3:18 that I may. 66:16; 71:17,24; 107:22; 118:17 The LXX., Vulgate, Arabic, and Ethiopic, add \"in the gates of the daughter of Zion;\" which makes a better conclusion; but it is not acknowledged by any MS. yet collated.</p>"}]}